    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Sam Hill is delighted to present to the market this gem of a mid terrace 2 bed 1 bathroom. This property is ideal for first time buyers investors or downsizers alike. Built in early 1900s No.73 has been maintained to a high standard.\r\n\r\nAccommodation:\r\nOn entry to the house you are greeted by a well presented bright living area. The large windows allow natural light to fill the space and it boasts a cozy fireplace for those cold winter nights. There is ample shelving either side of the fireplace. Flooring is timber style laminate.\r\n\r\nUnder the alcove at the rear is a nicely laid out kitchen with modern appliances, wooden cabinets and tile splash-back. The kitchen steps out onto a small private back yard.\r\n\r\nUpstairs to the front of the property is a spacious double bedroom and to the rear is the second bedroom. Both are well presented and have laminate flooring. At the top of the stairs is a nice sized bathroom with electric shower. \r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
